	"Author": "Asterisk555",
	"Description": "[u]Description[/u]\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Adds furniture from NPC houses as alternative textures for your furniture and walls and floors\n<br />[*]There's witchy furniture, game room furniture, various electronics, bathroom furniture, and many others.\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[u]Quick start[/u]\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*]Download and extract this mod and it's requirements into your mods folder (if you are confused check out\u00A0[url=https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Modding:Player_Guide/Getting_Started#Getting_started]this guide[/url]\uFEFF).\n<br />[*]It's ready to play. Buy the paint bucket at Robin's shop to retexture items. There is a\u00A0[url=https://youtu.be/OzCzEppsXVY]video[/url]\uFEFF on how to use the mod in-game.\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[u]Compatibility[/u]\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Alternative Textures (AT) version works with lots of other mods\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[u]Mods that go well with this one[/u]\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10982]Adorable Cottage Bathroom[/url]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/12372]Painting Displays[/url]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/11597]Beam Mod[/url]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10473]Cozy Kitchen[/url]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/12219]Chests as baskets[/url]\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF\uFEFF\n<br />[/list]",
